              Set the close‐on‐exec flag (FFDD__CCLLOOEEXXEECC) on the new file descrip‐
              tor.  See the description of the OO__CCLLOOEEXXEECC flag in ooppeenn(2).

       FFAANN__NNOONNBBLLOOCCKK
              Enable the nonblocking flag (OO__NNOONNBBLLOOCCKK) for the  file  descrip‐
              tor.  Reading from the file descriptor will not block.  Instead,
