              Report  thread  ID  (TID) instead of process ID (PID) in the _p_i_d
              field of the _s_t_r_u_c_t _f_a_n_o_t_i_f_y___e_v_e_n_t___m_e_t_a_d_a_t_a supplied to  rreeaadd(2)
              (see  ffaannoottiiffyy(7)).  Use of this flag requires the CCAAPP__SSYYSS__AADDMMIINN
