              ally, it may be used for applications monitoring a directory  or
              a  filesystem that are interested in the directory entry modifi‐
              cation events FFAANN__CCRREEAATTEE, FFAANN__DDEELLEETTEE, FFAANN__MMOOVVEE, and  FFAANN__RREENNAAMMEE,
