              child    object.     The    use    of    FFAANN__CCLLAASSSS__CCOONNTTEENNTT    or
              FFAANN__CCLLAASSSS__PPRREE__CCOONNTTEENNTT  is  not permitted with this flag and will
              result in the error EEIINNVVAALL.  See ffaannoottiiffyy(7) for additional  de‐
              tails.

       FFAANN__RREEPPOORRTT__DDIIRR__FFIIDD (since Linux 5.9)
              Events  for fanotify groups initialized with this flag will con‐
              tain (see exceptions below) additional information about  a  di‐
              rectory  object correlated to an event.  An additional record of
              type FFAANN__EEVVEENNTT__IINNFFOO__TTYYPPEE__DDFFIIDD encapsulates the information about
